{"id":"2358ea48972953a9","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-interpretability-box-definition.md","title":"解释性联结词恢复方框的语义","display":"lem-interpretability-box-definition — 解释性联结词恢复方框的语义","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-interpretability-box-definition","aliases":["72-lem-interpretability-box-definition"],"display":"lem-interpretability-box-definition — 解释性联结词恢复方框的语义","depends_on":["[[72-df-veltman-forcing]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Corollary13.2(b) and §13.6, print515–516/PDF527–528; local semantic form","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-interpretability-box-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-interpretability-box-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-interpretability-box-definition — 解释性联结词恢复方框的语义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e82291b3e069169\" href=\"?note=3e82291b3e069169\" title=\"72-df-veltman-forcing\">72-df-veltman-forcing</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Corollary13.2(b) and §13.6, print515–516/PDF527–528; local semantic form"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak V=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak V=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle\\)</span> 为 Veltman 模型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(A\\triangleright\\bot_m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\Box_m\\neg_m A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(A\\triangleright\\bot_m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\Box_m\\neg_m A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\Box_m A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(\\neg_m A\\triangleright\\bot_m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\Box_m A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(\\neg_m A\\triangleright\\bot_m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>假公式在任何世界不成立，因此 A▷⊥ 要求根本没有满足 A 的 R 后继，正是 □¬A。用 A 的否定代入并使用逐世界经典双重否定得到第二式。该局部证明不需要完整 IL 完备性；也未将它无说明升级为任意对象理论内的解释性等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-veltman-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"3e82291b3e069169","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-veltman-forcing]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak V=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(A\\triangleright\\bot_m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\Box_m\\neg_m A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\Box_m A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(\\neg_m A\\triangleright\\bot_m).","display":true}],"bytes":1480,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-64","locations":[